  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Geo 303.02 Re-Examinations. Candidates failing an examination shall be entitled to re-examination upon payment of the examination fee pursuant to Geo 305.02.\n\nSource. #7526, eff 7-1-01; ss by #9439, eff 3-25-09; ss by #12152, eff 3-24-17",
